WEBVTT

00:18.080 --> 00:19.830
<b>How's life out here?</b>

00:21.040 --> 00:21.980
<b>Morning.</b>

00:22.630 --> 00:24.040
<b>It's not as bad as I thought.</b>

00:24.750 --> 00:26.750
<b>No bug bites?</b>

00:26.990 --> 00:27.750
<b>Nope.</b>

00:36.490 --> 00:38.930
<b>I've caused you a lot of grief.</b>

00:39.550 --> 00:40.890
<b>Where did that come from?</b>

00:41.340 --> 00:44.470
<b>Well, we're going to be living together now.</b>

00:44.750 --> 00:48.610
<b>I figured we should get some of the 
serious talk out of the way first.</b>

00:51.100 --> 00:52.280
<b>It's pretty good.</b>

00:52.460 --> 00:53.280
<b>Right?</b>

00:53.280 --> 00:54.330
<b>Thinly-sliced ham.</b>

00:54.570 --> 00:58.030
<b>Tastes great lightly fried with olive oil.</b>

01:00.440 --> 01:02.860
<b>Normally, parents dragging a child around</b>

01:02.860 --> 01:05.160
<b>for their own personal reasons is...</b>

01:06.100 --> 01:07.480
<b>We have dependents.</b>

01:07.650 --> 01:10.500
<b>We have to expect it to some extent.</b>

01:11.230 --> 01:13.230
<b>That makes me feel better.</b>

01:13.230 --> 01:15.760
<b>But that's only when the child</b>

01:15.760 --> 01:17.890
<b>is small and can't live on his own yet.</b>

01:18.920 --> 01:20.320
<b><i>Let's go together.</i></b>

01:20.320 --> 01:22.390
<b><i>Maybe that's not it.</i></b>

01:28.240 --> 01:29.400
<b>Do you always listen to this?</b>

01:31.200 --> 01:34.650
<b>It's a little embarrassing when 
you're around, but I guess.</b>

01:35.780 --> 01:39.290
<b>Out of all Mom's performances, 
this is one I like quite a bit, too.</b>

01:40.110 --> 01:41.100
<b>Yeah?</b>

03:22.550 --> 03:26.430
<b>Episode 4:
"Steep Road"</b>

03:26.560 --> 03:27.810
<b>Sacchan</b>

03:31.760 --> 03:33.500
<b>Sacchan? How are you?</b>

03:33.500 --> 03:34.970
<b>Feeling okay?</b>

03:34.970 --> 03:37.390
<b>It's been two days since we went hiking,</b>

03:37.390 --> 03:40.050
<b>and my legs still hurt.</b>

03:40.450 --> 03:44.260
<i>Yeah, my legs are fine, but—</i>

03:44.260 --> 03:46.420
<b>Are you being hospitalized?</b>

03:46.420 --> 03:48.300
<i>What? You already knew?</i>

03:48.740 --> 03:50.580
<i>Yanagi-chan should be fine.</i>

03:50.880 --> 03:53.080
<i>It's not bad enough that she needs to stay.</i>

03:53.080 --> 03:54.170
<b>Yana-chan?!</b>

03:54.410 --> 03:55.080
<i>Yeah.</i>

03:55.350 --> 03:57.380
<i>I got a call from Yukinari-kun.</i>

03:57.380 --> 03:59.590
<i>Yanagi-chan hurt her leg during a lesson.</i>

04:07.680 --> 04:08.980
<b>Thank you.</b>

04:14.120 --> 04:15.170
<b>Let's go.</b>

04:17.570 --> 04:18.400
<b>Are you okay?</b>

04:18.830 --> 04:20.510
<b>It's just a sprain.</b>

04:20.510 --> 04:22.420
<b>You didn't have to come.</b>

04:22.420 --> 04:25.270
<b>Of course I did. We're family.</b>

04:26.500 --> 04:27.660
<b>What's with the face?</b>

04:27.660 --> 04:28.890
<b>Nothing.</b>

04:28.890 --> 04:30.740
<b>What do you mean "nothing"?</b>

04:30.740 --> 04:32.500
<b>Sorry, thanks.</b>

04:32.910 --> 04:35.340
<b>What? We aren't strangers.</b>

04:43.570 --> 04:44.560
<b>Don't run.</b>

04:44.560 --> 04:46.110
<b>Hurry!</b>

04:46.110 --> 04:47.210
<b>Fine, fine.</b>

04:50.820 --> 04:52.430
<b>Whoa, Yana-chan?</b>

04:52.670 --> 04:53.920
<b>Yukinari-kun.</b>

05:12.860 --> 05:14.920
<b>Never mind. You're heavy.</b>

05:15.740 --> 05:16.940
<b>Yuki.</b>

05:20.780 --> 05:22.980
<b>Oh? I'm jealous.</b>

05:23.310 --> 05:24.450
<b>Like this?</b>

05:24.450 --> 05:26.930
<b>Friendship punch!</b>

05:31.340 --> 05:33.550
<i>Yeah, I'm a lot better.</i>

05:33.550 --> 05:35.470
<b>Okay, see you.</b>

05:38.310 --> 05:39.810
<b>Wind, Sand, and Stars
Antoine de Saint-Exupéry</b>

05:45.870 --> 05:47.250
<b>Hello.</b>

05:52.800 --> 05:54.030
<b>Morning.</b>

05:54.030 --> 05:56.250
<b>I'm here to return that book.</b>

05:57.590 --> 05:58.750
<b>You read it already?</b>

05:58.750 --> 06:00.040
<b>Y-Yeah.</b>

06:00.040 --> 06:01.350
<b>It was good.</b>

06:01.350 --> 06:03.990
<b>That fly in the bus, in the desert—</b>

06:03.990 --> 06:04.800
<b>Do you want to come in?</b>

06:28.240 --> 06:30.910
<i>To think that this was the future.</i>

06:32.070 --> 06:34.890
<i>Knowing that, it makes me curious.</i>

06:36.010 --> 06:38.540
<i>But I don't want a bad future.</i>

06:39.390 --> 06:43.180
<i>I want to see a future that I'm happy with.</i>

06:45.610 --> 06:49.610
<i>I wonder what's going to happen 
with Yana-chan and Yuki-kun.</i>

06:49.930 --> 06:52.340
<i>And with me.</i>

06:52.850 --> 06:53.570
<b>Hey,</b>

06:54.470 --> 06:55.770
<b>focus.</b>

06:55.770 --> 06:56.770
<b>You'll get hurt.</b>

06:57.040 --> 06:57.820
<b>Okay.</b>

07:06.180 --> 07:07.190
<b>Ow.</b>

07:09.320 --> 07:10.610
<b>Full of Fruits
White Panda</b>

07:18.090 --> 07:19.580
<b>Today's special.</b>

07:45.550 --> 07:47.830
<b>Sure. I'll be fine.</b>

07:48.130 --> 07:50.330
<b>I want to walk to do some rehab anyway.</b>

07:51.190 --> 07:51.900
<b>See ya.</b>

07:53.630 --> 07:55.330
<b>Up we go.</b>

08:20.270 --> 08:21.020
<b>Sorry.</b>

08:21.540 --> 08:22.610
<b>No.</b>

08:23.050 --> 08:26.360
<b>Honestly, I don't even know 
what you're apologizing for.</b>

08:27.580 --> 08:28.300
<b>Yeah.</b>

08:29.050 --> 08:31.020
<b>Sure, it was a shock,</b>

08:31.320 --> 08:33.410
<b>but what could I expect?</b>

08:33.710 --> 08:35.780
<b>It's not your fault at all.</b>

08:35.780 --> 08:36.920
<b>That's not it!</b>

08:39.300 --> 08:42.010
<b>My heart was racing.</b>

08:46.470 --> 08:47.320
<b>So—</b>

08:47.320 --> 08:48.160
<b>Of course.</b>

08:49.210 --> 08:51.230
<b>That would happen to any girl,</b>

08:51.230 --> 08:54.190
<b>if a guy said that he liked her.</b>

08:54.640 --> 08:56.940
<b>Yeah. You're right.</b>

08:57.390 --> 08:58.280
<b>Of course.</b>

09:02.670 --> 09:03.500
<b>David.</b>

09:04.670 --> 09:05.850
<b>Okikura-kun.</b>

09:05.850 --> 09:07.260
<b>Kakeru Okikura.</b>

09:07.780 --> 09:09.630
<b>He's kind of hot, isn't he?</b>

09:09.630 --> 09:12.760
<b>Really? I think he's a bit stuck-up.</b>

09:13.060 --> 09:13.910
<b>True.</b>

09:13.910 --> 09:15.630
<b>He seems a bit self-centered.</b>

09:15.950 --> 09:17.470
<b>Pretty self-centered.</b>

09:23.480 --> 09:26.050
<b>I lied to you.</b>

09:27.480 --> 09:30.250
<b>I never intended to confess to Yuki.</b>

09:31.160 --> 09:33.090
<b>No! You just</b>

09:33.090 --> 09:35.330
<b>hadn't made up your mind.</b>

09:35.330 --> 09:37.530
<b>I mean, you were still unsure.</b>

09:37.530 --> 09:39.880
<b>That's not lying.</b>

09:39.880 --> 09:43.050
<b>Of course you couldn't make up your mind.</b>

09:43.050 --> 09:45.760
<b>You're a girl. You'd get nervous!</b>

09:47.160 --> 09:48.210
<b>I guess.</b>

09:48.760 --> 09:50.270
<b>Thanks, Touko.</b>

09:50.700 --> 09:53.970
<b>Again, I don't even know what for.</b>

10:04.900 --> 10:08.230
<b>I'm glad I came outside.</b>

10:09.460 --> 10:12.280
<b>I'll be fine on my way home. Don't worry.</b>

10:13.030 --> 10:14.920
<b>I'll be doing this at the school yard.</b>

10:15.350 --> 10:17.090
<b>Show me your sketches next time.</b>

10:18.490 --> 10:19.180
<b>I don't know.</b>

10:38.690 --> 10:39.740
<b>It's been a while.</b>

10:40.490 --> 10:42.310
<b>Roger, was it?</b>

10:42.660 --> 10:43.670
<b>Oh, and that's—</b>

10:43.670 --> 10:45.450
<b>Hi, Jonathan!</b>

10:58.510 --> 10:59.830
<b>Okikura-kun?</b>

11:15.090 --> 11:15.840
<b>Hey.</b>

11:16.710 --> 11:17.780
<b>Yuki-kun.</b>

11:17.780 --> 11:20.020
<b>What are you doing at school?</b>

11:20.880 --> 11:22.660
<b>Can I sit beside you?</b>

11:22.660 --> 11:25.340
<b>Sure, of course.</b>

11:27.510 --> 11:29.290
<b>We aren't strangers, Yuki-kun.</b>

11:29.890 --> 11:30.880
<b>I guess.</b>

11:31.510 --> 11:33.340
<b>I guess it'll be a bit awkward</b>

11:33.340 --> 11:36.120
<b>after what I said.</b>

11:37.550 --> 11:38.470
<b>Sorry.</b>

11:39.300 --> 11:41.930
<b>I thought you were Okikura-kun.</b>

11:44.320 --> 11:46.390
<b>I like that about you.</b>

11:48.290 --> 11:50.280
<b>What are you—</b>

11:50.710 --> 11:53.710
<b>Wait, what do you like about me?</b>

11:54.280 --> 11:56.700
<b>You're just a little bit rude.</b>

11:59.460 --> 12:00.860
<b>Just sit down.</b>

13:03.110 --> 13:04.640
<b>They made a movie.</b>

13:05.270 --> 13:06.050
<b>See,</b>

13:06.660 --> 13:08.140
<b>there's a banner ad.</b>

13:06.930 --> 13:09.560
<b>Exile and the Kingdom</b>

13:06.930 --> 13:09.560
<b>The classic reborn
In theaters now</b>

13:08.140 --> 13:09.560
<b><i>Exile and the Kingdom.</i></b>

13:10.320 --> 13:12.590
<b>Um, wanna go see, maybe?</b>

13:12.590 --> 13:13.270
<b>Sure.</b>

13:13.270 --> 13:15.120
<b>Wait, I'll check the times.</b>

13:17.550 --> 13:19.280
<b>Are you free the day after tomorrow?</b>

13:19.280 --> 13:20.030
<b>Sure.</b>

13:20.030 --> 13:20.950
<b>Then—</b>

13:24.780 --> 13:25.960
<b>Pins and needles!</b>

13:30.600 --> 13:32.490
<b>Maybe it's still too early.</b>

13:43.650 --> 13:47.080
<b>Hey, what are you doing at school today?</b>

13:47.730 --> 13:49.180
<b>Uh...</b>

13:49.180 --> 13:50.780
<b>Huh? What?</b>

13:51.600 --> 13:53.740
<b>I saw you walking through the gate.</b>

13:54.300 --> 13:55.520
<b>You mean you—</b>

13:58.400 --> 14:00.020
<b>Just sit down.</b>

14:14.890 --> 14:16.160
<b>Are you happy with that?</b>

14:16.800 --> 14:18.280
<b>Not really.</b>

14:19.470 --> 14:21.150
<b>You want me to grab them for you?</b>

14:22.630 --> 14:24.420
<b>I figured this would happen, so...</b>

14:24.720 --> 14:26.920
<b>Ta–da! Here.</b>

14:28.590 --> 14:29.530
<b>Rice grains?</b>

14:29.530 --> 14:30.500
<b>Thanks.</b>

14:43.280 --> 14:47.050
<b>But don't you kind of think 
ground-baiting is cheap?</b>

14:47.350 --> 14:48.620
<b>You know what...</b>

15:24.870 --> 15:26.320
<b>Looks like it's going to rain.</b>

15:26.770 --> 15:27.610
<b>Shoot.</b>

15:54.700 --> 15:56.590
<b>I'll be done in a second, sorry.</b>

15:56.970 --> 15:58.680
<b>There should be some conté 
crayons left here...</b>

15:59.150 --> 16:01.170
<b>Um... Found it!</b>

16:02.960 --> 16:04.510
<b>What's wrong?</b>

16:04.510 --> 16:05.370
<b>I can't.</b>

16:06.700 --> 16:10.650
<b>I can't be in a room alone with you.</b>

16:12.180 --> 16:14.140
<b>Touko, are you thinking</b>

16:14.140 --> 16:16.690
<b>about that Kakeru guy?</b>

16:17.760 --> 16:18.870
<b>What now?</b>

16:19.440 --> 16:21.120
<b>Do you like him?</b>

16:22.840 --> 16:24.750
<b>I see. You do.</b>

16:25.410 --> 16:26.920
<b>No, that's not it.</b>

16:27.210 --> 16:31.180
<b>You thought I was Kakeru earlier.</b>

16:32.130 --> 16:33.430
<b>You're waiting for him.</b>

16:34.160 --> 16:36.050
<b>Deep down, you were waiting for him.</b>

16:46.980 --> 16:48.940
<b>I said too much. I'm leaving.</b>

17:02.110 --> 17:05.310
<b>I like...</b>

17:06.660 --> 17:07.540
<b>Okikura-kun?</b>

17:41.750 --> 17:42.510
<b>This way.</b>

17:54.870 --> 17:55.860
<b>Thanks.</b>

17:56.640 --> 17:58.460
<b>I might have been screwed if I were alone.</b>

17:59.500 --> 18:00.300
<b>I'm—</b>

18:00.300 --> 18:01.040
<b>Davi—</b>

18:01.720 --> 18:03.220
<b>Kakeru Okikura.</b>

18:04.360 --> 18:06.790
<b>You're one of Touko's friends.</b>

18:07.090 --> 18:08.480
<b>Yanagi Takayama.</b>

18:09.870 --> 18:11.480
<b>Your leg looks painful.</b>

18:11.890 --> 18:13.150
<b>It's just a sprain.</b>

18:13.450 --> 18:16.010
<b>I'm not impressed that 
you'd walk around on that.</b>

18:17.290 --> 18:19.030
<b>Kakeru is such a weird name.</b>

18:20.220 --> 18:22.610
<b>Yanagi is a nice name.</b>

18:22.920 --> 18:23.830
<b>Hiragana?</b>

18:24.440 --> 18:27.050
<b>The kanji looks ghastly, so hiragana.</b>

18:27.640 --> 18:29.300
<b>Flexible but tough.</b>

18:30.470 --> 18:32.050
<b>Modest and strong.</b>

18:33.290 --> 18:33.960
<b>What—</b>

18:38.960 --> 18:39.970
<b>Kakeru is—</b>

18:40.250 --> 18:41.590
<b>"Horse" and "section."</b>

18:42.330 --> 18:45.610
<b>To make horses run, or to chase 
them down—something like that.</b>

18:46.500 --> 18:48.560
<b>They may have intended to imply</b>

18:48.560 --> 18:51.120
<b>I was lacking in some way.</b>

18:51.800 --> 18:55.280
<b>I don't think anyone's parents 
would mean something like that.</b>

18:56.360 --> 18:57.550
<b>You think?</b>

18:57.550 --> 18:59.070
<b>Of course.</b>

18:59.760 --> 19:01.490
<b>You... think?</b>

19:05.830 --> 19:07.560
<b>Come on, get inside.</b>

19:09.620 --> 19:11.630
<b>It's starting to rain over there.</b>

19:14.610 --> 19:17.840
<b>You're lucky you have 
nothing to worry about.</b>

19:20.080 --> 19:21.260
<b>It's really coming down!</b>

19:32.720 --> 19:33.820
<b>The rain's stopping.</b>

19:47.990 --> 19:49.190
<b>Thanks for—</b>

20:10.790 --> 20:12.750
<b>So now my doctor</b>

20:12.750 --> 20:16.080
<b>is this fresh new lady.</b>

20:16.080 --> 20:17.010
<b>Yeah?</b>

20:17.310 --> 20:20.210
<b>She listens to my lungs 
with her stethoscope.</b>

20:20.210 --> 20:21.620
<b>She keeps going,</b>

20:21.620 --> 20:25.810
<b>"And breathe in. Breathe out."</b>

20:25.810 --> 20:27.910
<b>Four times in front, four times in the back.</b>

20:28.470 --> 20:30.340
<b>And she looks all disappointed</b>

20:30.340 --> 20:32.710
<b>and says, "Your lungs sound nice."</b>

20:33.370 --> 20:36.920
<b>Like, are you really that 
into the sound of my lungs?</b>

20:37.220 --> 20:37.920
<b>Hmm.</b>

20:38.300 --> 20:39.800
<b>You didn't like my story?</b>

20:39.800 --> 20:42.720
<b>Dad, you should probably stop there.</b>

20:44.250 --> 20:45.680
<b>Should I?</b>

20:53.940 --> 20:56.810
<b>Peak
Dinner
Shopping
Rendezvous

Dinner: Family restaurant?
Washroom: 5 times
*Don't panic</b>

20:53.940 --> 20:56.810
<b> Date Schedule
So nice!                     I've got this</b>

20:57.860 --> 20:59.190
<b>Score!</b>

21:15.270 --> 21:16.740
<b>Thanks for waiting.</b>

21:24.760 --> 21:27.010
<b>Hey, where's Hiro-kun today?</b>

21:28.830 --> 21:30.350
<b>I think he's on a date.</b>

21:30.650 --> 21:31.960
<b>A date?!</b>

21:37.600 --> 21:41.070
<b>Dance School</b>

21:54.540 --> 21:56.490
<b></b>

21:58.040 --> 21:59.260
<b></b>

23:29.600 --> 23:31.760
<b>So many surprises today.</b>

23:31.760 --> 23:33.860
<b>I wanted to talk to you.</b>

23:33.860 --> 23:35.120
<b>I can't tell you yet.</b>

23:35.870 --> 23:37.140
<i>Want to come over right now?</i>

23:37.140 --> 23:39.100
<b>Episode 5:
"Hinode Bridge"</b>

23:39.100 --> 23:41.100
<b></b>
